  "metadata": {
    "track_number": 10,
    "bonus_track": true,
    "keys_synth": "rhodes",
    "concept": "A wordless torch-song lament. The lead voice is FormantVocaloidSynth pushed into a role it was never built for -- a full sung phrase rather than an accent -- and it can only ache through vowels, because that is genuinely all it can do: no consonants, no words, just formant resonance. It ends on the Phrygian flat-2, unresolved, mid-sentence."
  }
